window.products.push({"id":91277,"name":"UPGRADED 240337901 Refrigerator Door Bin Shelf Rack Compatible with Frigidaire Refrigerator Door Shelf Replacement Refrigerator Shelves Parts 24033790","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KrYnRaokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【NOTICE-Warm Tips】The 240337901 refrigerator door bin dimension is Width: 6-1/4\", Depth: 5-1/2\", Maximum Length: 24-3/4\".only for the middle door bin rack of the refrigerator! The top door bin as well as the bottom door bin are not compatible, you need to go for the model number 240338101 to replace the bottom door bin and 240338001 to replace the top shelf. Please be careful not to buy the wrong model number! Refer to the picture for details! 【Part Number】240337901 Refrigerator Door Shelf replace part number: 240337901, AP2115858, 240337904, 240337905, 891047, AH429868, EA429868, PS429868. Width: 6-1/4\", Depth: 5-1/2\", Maximum Length: 24-3/4\". Please measure your old Door Shelf Rack Bar to make sure the Width: 6-1/4\", otherwise 240337901 refrigerator door bin replacement doesn't fit your refrigerator! 【Premium Material】240337901 frigidaire door bin replacement of stronger material greatly improves the life cycle of the product and will not break easily. With a perfect fit installation, there is no risk of the items on the replacement shelf falling off. Food grade material allows you to put food on the product with peace of mind and is more cost-effective than OEM shelves. 【Compatible Models】240337901 door bin Rack Compatible with Frigidaire Refrigerator door shelf replacement. If your model starts with FRT18, FRT21, FFHI18, FFHI21, FFHT18, FFHT21, FFTI21, FFTR18, FFTR2, LFHT18, LFHT21, GRT18, GRT21, GLRT13, GLHT21, GLRT8, GLRT18, GLRT21, GLHT18, FRT8S, FRT1S, FRT8, CFHT18, CFTR18, CGTR18, 2536, 2537, these fridge door shelf replacements are compatible with your fridge. Please confirm your model and read our homepage and photos in detail. 【Quality Service】If there are any quality problems such as yellowing of 240337901 door bin, easy to break or poor installation, we will unconditionally refund or fully replace. If you don't know whether your own refrigerator is compatible with the door bin rack, you can always contact us and we will assist you in finding the appropriate refrigerator door bin rack model.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KrYnRaokL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luckman","source_asin":"B0BNBLQ183","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNBLQ183","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNBLQ183","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
