window.products.push({"id":91405,"name":"Techecook 4392065 Dryer Repair Kit with 349241T Drum Roller Kit,691366 Idler Pulley and 341241 Belt - Replacement for Whirlpool & Kenmore Dryers - Rep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712OxADWdtL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【 4392065 DRYER REPAIR KIT】4392065 Dryer Maintenance Kit for 29 wide dryers with the lint filter located on the top of the dryer. 691366 Dryer Idler Pulley keeps tension on the dryer drum belt. Ken-more 8066065 Dryer Belt 341241 is 92 1/4\" long, 1/4\" wide, 4 ribs, 3 grooves. Replaces some wider 5 rib belts. Drum support roller kit 349241T holds the drum in place while the drum rotates on the support wheels.‎ Each one has been strict testing by manufacturer before leaving the factory ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】4392065 29'' Dryer Repair Kit includes 1 x 691366 dryer Idler pulley,1 x 341241 whirl-pool dryer drum belt , 2 x 349241T dryer drum Rollers, 4 x tri-rings, 2 x clips. ✅4392065 dryer repair kit for whirl-pool is made of Metal and ABS prevents cracking and failing during the installation and use process , quality equal to OEM requirements. ✅ 【365-DAYS WARRANTY】During the warranty period, if the 4392065 Dryer Repair Kit for whirlpool has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer’s satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the ad-miral dryer repair kit , please contact us immediately. Everything fit as it should, and was fairly easy to replace ✅【BROAD COMPATIBILITY】4392065 Whirl-pool Dryer Roller Kit for 29\" wide dryers is made exactly fit for most top name brands (Whirl-pool ,Ken-more, Kitchen-Aid, Ad-miral, Ma-gic, Cros-ley, May-tag, ama-na ). Replaces dryer parts number : 26000279435, 26000279436, 279435, 279436, 279708, 279708MS, 279709, 279709MS, 279860,4392065VP, AP3131942 fits for MEDC300BW0, WED4815EW1, WED4800XQ1, WGD4815EW2, PS373087, RED4516FW0, WED6200SW1 repair kit etc. ✅ 【FIXES SYMPTOMS】If your dryer is noisy, will not tumble, leaves marks on clothes, or will not start etc. Replace ama-na dryer roller kit can easly solve these dryer problem .The whirl-pool roller replacement kit is very easy to install, saving your maintenance time and cost. If you are not sure whether our the 4392065 Dryer Repair Roller Kit fits your dryers, please feel free to contact us to help you check.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712OxADWdtL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B08N524CSD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N524CSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N524CSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
