window.products.push({"id":91697,"name":"Siwdoy 285785 Washer Clutch Kit, 285753A Motor Coupling Kit and 4 pcs 80040 Washer Agitator Dog Compatible with Whirlpool Washer 285331, 3351342, 3946","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617XanC3Q9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"285785 washer clutch assembly is found in your washing machine and is responsible for spinning the basket during the spin cycle. This repair requires a half inch 1/16th socket with an extension and a ratchet, a pair of channel lock pliers, a Phillips screwdriver, medium size flat blade, a small flat blade, and a 1/4 inch nut driver.  Replaces part numbers: 2670, 285331, 285380, 285422, 285540, 285761, 285785, 285785VP, 3350015, 3350114, 3350115, 3351342, 3351343, 387888, 388948, 388949, 3946794, 3946847, 3951311, 3951312, 62699, 63174, 63765, 64176, AP3094537. 285753A motor coupling , also known as a coupling kit, is a newer version of the part and is used in your washer. The piece includes new metal sleeves that have been added in order to strengthen the part. This part works between the transmission and the motor; it is only used on direct drive washers with no belt. In order to replace this part, you will need a flat blade screw driver, a quarter inch nut driver, and a Phillips screw driver. Before making this repair remember to disconnect the power supply, and both fill hoses. Replace part number:1195967, 21003, 280152, 285140, 285743, 285753, 285753A, 285753AVP, 3352470, 3363664, 3364002, 3364003, 62672, 62693, 661560, 80008, 8559748, AP3963893, ER285753, SB285753A. 80040 Washer Agitator Dogs replaces part number: 285612, 285770, 3109, 3366877, 387091, 80040, 80040VP, 99989668, AP3119063, ER80040, SB80040. Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, KitchenAid, Roper, Estate, Inglis, Crosley, Amana, Maytag, Admiral, Magic Chef. Package list: 285785 Washer Clutch Kit 285753A Washer Motor Coupler Kit with Metal Reinforced Core 4 PCS 80040 Washer Agitator Dogs Siwdoy Customer Service Siwdoy is committed to providing each customer best customer service. if any question ,Please don't hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617XanC3Q9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Siwdoy","source_asin":"B07G5R8V7R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G5R8V7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G5R8V7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":91698,"name":"CHEFJOY Built-in Ice Maker, Undercounter Ice Maker Machine w/Drain Pump, 24H Timer, 24LBS Ice Bin, Reversible Door, Commercial Ice Cube Maker Machine,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kvriqtceL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Get adequate ice every day with our built-in ice maker! With a productivity of 80 lbs of ice each day, this ice maker can offer enough ice for you. In addition, the heat insulated materials will keep the ice cool and intact. You can determine the ice thickness according to different needs. You can use it as a freestanding ice maker or an under-counter ice machine. And the 2-way door with stainless steel handle allows you to install it whether on the right or the left. When it comes to daily cleaning, the automatic cleaning mode helps a lot. You can press the “Timer/Clean” button on the control panel and the ice maker will clean itself. The premium drain pump with a maximum height of 35.5” makes water drain out rapidly. Features: 3 different ice thickness meets various requirements LCD control panel for simple operation and clear display 3-layer structure prevents the ice from melting quickly Self-cleaning design saves your time and energy a lot Provided drain pump with max height of 35.5” stimulates water drainage 80 lbs of ice per day & 11-20 minutes ice making cycle 24 lbs large ice bin for ice storage and 3.2L water tank for water storage Specifications: Color: Silver + Black Material: Stainless Steel, PP, Zinc-Plate Sheet, ABS Product Dimension: 15\" x 20\" x 33.5\" Dimension of Ice Bin: 12\" x 12\" x 13.5\" Voltage: 115V Frequency: 60 Hz Ice Making Capacity (24H): 80 lbs Max Ice Storage Capacity: 24 lbs Timer: 0-24H Power Cord: 71.5\" Water Inlet Hose: 10 ft Water Outlet Hose: 6.5 ft Net Weight: 53 lbs Package Includes: 1 x Built-in Ice Maker 1 x Ice Scoop 1 x Drain Pump 1 x Water Quick-connector 1 x Water Outlet Hose 1 x Water Inlet Hose 1 x Removable Ice Bin 1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kvriqtceL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHEFJOY","source_asin":"B0BM9SRHQL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91698","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM9SRHQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM9SRHQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
