window.products.push({"id":91907,"name":"Egg Holder Container For Refrigerator - CooSilo Automatic Rolling Double-Layer Egg Storage Box Rack with Lid Large Capacity 36 Count Fridge Egg Organi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sq4RIktmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🥚【Durable Food Grade PP Material】Made of safe environmental PP material, our egg organizer for refrigerator is solid and durable, which can be used for a long time. The lid is strong enough to stack other things on top, saving more space in refrigerator along with being neat and beautiful. The groove design prevents eggs from shaking and breaking and the smooth round edges do not hurt your hands. 🥚【Auto Rolling Design】Adopted gentle 7° slope design with a large opening, when the eggs are taken out, the remaining eggs will roll off automatically to fill the place and you will take the eggs out easily without opening the lid. In your busy routine, it will prove to be the most convenient egg holder you would ever have. 🥚【Stack For Large Capacity 】With 2 layer design, our Egg storage container for refrigerator can store 18 eggs per layer with 36 grid capacity in all, which is enough to meet the needs of a family for a week. The egg tray is fixed with a card slot, which is firm reliable and effectively prevent the egg from colliding and breaking. It can be stacked easily to keep the refrigerator tidy and organized. 🥚【Translucent & Semi-enclosed Design】The translucent coffee color eggs container for refrigerator allows the quantity of the remaining eggs to be clear at a glance, which is convenient for timely replenishment. The semi-enclosed design provides good ventilation and helps eggs to stay fresh for a long time. 🥚【Easy To Clean With Removable Lid】The top cover of the egg holder is removable, allowing you to load eggs and clean the tray easily. Use warm water to wash it directly or wipe with a rag. The smooth finish ensures very easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sq4RIktmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CooSilo","source_asin":"B09V772PCR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91907","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V772PCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V772PCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
