window.products.push({"id":91970,"name":"ARLIME Portable Ice Maker Machine, 26Lbs/24H Self-Cleaning Ice Maker, 9 Ice Cubes S/L Ready in 6 Mins, Small Cube Ice Maker with Ice Scoop and Basket,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JgR6f1YWL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥃7 Mins Fast Ice Making: Portable ice maker machine produces 9 ice cubes in only 7 minutes, you'll get 26 pounds of chewable ice cubes every 24 hours. You can use it anytime for Drinks, Food, Seafood, Smoothies, etc. 🥃2 Sizes of Ice: This ice maker machine countertop offers S/L ice cubes options, which is better meet your demands on ice cubes for different drinks! The large ice is great for filling in a cooler or keeping drinks cool for longer, while the small cubes can be easily broken up by a blender, suitable for making smoothies or other frozen drinks. 🥃Super Ice Making Capacity: Equipped with a high-efficiency compressor, this ice maker countertop not only has an excellent cooling effect, but also produces less noise during the ice making process. Allows you to enjoy delicious ice cubes and drinks in a quiet environment. The counter ice machine also has a 2.1L circulating water tank, which will not cause waste. 🥃Self Cleaning Function: Automatic cleaning function makes it easy and effortless to clean up, saving a lot of trouble when your ice maker needs cleaning. Made of food-grade ABS+PP material, this tabletop ice maker machine can replace your ice trays and keep your cooler full all day. 🥃Compact And Easy To Use: ARLIME ice maker machine countertop is user-friendly. No need to install and it is small enough to place the portable ice maker countertop anywhere. It also has a large transparent window to check the progress of ice making. Equipped with a removable ice basket and ice scoop, so you can move ice cubes very easily. Perfect for any countertop, Kitchen, Living room, Bedroom, Office, Party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JgR6f1YWL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B088FT9S24","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-91970","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088FT9S24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088FT9S24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
